Veldt Wisp began as a fork of DynamicIslandMusic. Its source has since been
rewritten from behavioural specification, and no third-party expression remains.
A small amount of convergent boilerplate — one-line use-case wrappers, a Hilt
module providing framework services, and a published lifecycle-owner recipe —
was deliberately retained because it takes the same form regardless of author.
The upstream copyright notice and the grant below are retained so that anything
so retained remains licensed.

